## Snap layouts

snap-zone = Acoplar al área de { $width } % por { $height } %

## Window title bars

title-bar-minimize = Minimizar
title-bar-maximize = Maximizar
title-bar-close = Cerrar

## Window resizing

window-resize-size = { $width } × { $height }

